  <p id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0000" ref="vtp_lo9_0af_AA">裴政</persName>，字<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0004" ref="vtp_lo9_0af_AA">德表</persName>，河東聞喜人也。高祖<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0016" ref="4kt_0ar_aqo">壽孫</persName>，從宋武帝徙家于壽陽，曆前軍長史、廬江太守。祖<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0041" ref="vtp_lo9_0af">邃</persName>，梁侍中、左衛將軍、豫州大都督。父<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p001:m0059" ref="vtp_lo9_0af_A">之禮</persName>，廷尉卿。</p>
  <p id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">向遣<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p002:m0002" ref="vtp_lo9_0af_AA">裴政</persName>、<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p002:m0005" ref="wz4_1s4_93m">劉行本</persName>在，共匡弼之，猶應不令至此。」子<persName id="c-suishu-066-peizheng-ancestry:p002:m0024" ref="vtp_lo9_0af_AAA">南金</persName>，仕至膳部郎。</p>
</text>
